Package: GAIA
Title: Multi-Omics Integration Toolkit for CUT&TAG, ATAC-seq, and RNA-seq
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yohan", "Lefol", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "yohan.lefol@gmail.com")
Description: Modular pipeline for multi-omics analysis including quality control,
    preprocessing, annotation, enrichment, integration, machine learning,
    statistical analysis, visualization, and reporting. Named after the
    subordinate functions from Horizon Zero Dawn.
